  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development, by reason of inappropriate detailed design and materials, fails to conserve and enhance the significance of the listed building and fails to preserve or enhance the character and appearance of the conservation area. Furthermore, the submitted information fails to demonstrate that the windows are beyond reasonable repair, therefore, the proposal is judged to cause harm to the significance of the listed building and the character and appearance of the conservation area.&amp;nbsp; The proposal would therefore fail to comply with policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) and LP3 (Designated Heritage Assets) of the Hackney Local Plan LP33 (2020) and policies D4 (Delivering good design) and HC1 (Heritage conservation and growth) of the London Plan (2020) and the advice in Hackney&#x27;s Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2025) and Hackney&#x27;s Retrofit SPD (2025) and the Kingsland Conservation Area Appraisal (2018).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
